KeyboardPillLayer 1.0 KeyboardPillLayer.qml

# The groups inside a PaneStyle. Internal because a style writes `insets.top`
# and `client.shadow.blur` and never names these -- they exist so QML can
# resolve those paths against a declared type, which is the only reason they
# are types at all. See Insets.qml.
internal Insets Insets.qml
internal ClientTreatment ClientTreatment.qml
internal ClientShadow ClientShadow.qml
